  "releaseNotes": "1.2.3: Realigned the package version with the repo's git tag numbering. No code changes. 1.0.3: Expanded the README's Sandbox payment walkthrough. No code changes. 1.0.2: Picks up PayPal.PartnerGateway 1.0.2, which fixes a real bug where bodyless POST/PUT/PATCH calls (order capture/authorize, refunds, etc.) were rejected by PayPal with 415 UNSUPPORTED_MEDIA_TYPE. No changes in this package's own code. 1.0.1: Added net9.0 as an explicit target framework alongside net8.0/net10.0 for broader compatibility. 1.0.0: Initial release - AddPayPalPartnerGateway() DI extensions and MapPayPalPartnerWebhook() signature-verified Minimal API webhook mapping.",
